{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03987","headline":"三月三日宴王明府山亭 · 韩仲宣","name":"三月三日宴王明府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河滨上巳，洛汭春华。\n碧池涵日，翠斝澄霞。\n沟垂细柳，岸拥平沙。\n歌莺响树，舞蝶惊花。\n云浮宝马，水韵香车。\n熟记行乐，淹留景斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}